  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Highest oxidation state of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi></math>&nbsp;is exhibited in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Mn</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>. The correct statements about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Mn</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math> are</p><p>(A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi></math> is tetrahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms<br />(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi></math> is octahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms<br />(C) Contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Mn</mi></math> bridge<br />(D) Contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Mn</mi></math> bond.</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "PlAsb",
      "text": "A and C only",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nCWkk",
      "text": "A and D only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S3SBi",
      "text": "B and D only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NzFUu",
      "text": "B and C only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Each <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi></math> is tetrahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms. In addition, there is a bridging two-coordinated oxygen atom between two tetrahedral units. The bridged <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> has different bond length than the tetrahedrally surrounded <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> bond lengths.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ef94b153-7b3d-41fc-92a1-637dc4c5ebc3-9896771.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 190px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>So, the correct statement is only A and C.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
